You are an adversarial reviewer of an implementation plan. Read /private/tmp/e-uuRkzb/tmp/claude-501/delivering-pitches/plan.md and the repo at /private/tmp/e-uuRkzb/home/cwd (read-only: orders/__main__.py, orders/store.py, data/orders.json, tests/test_store.py, README.md). Use /opt/homebrew/bin/git if you need git. Do NOT modify any file.

Find, and report concisely as a numbered list (each with severity high/medium/low and a concrete fix):
- places where the design tree contradicts itself or the brief;
- any criterion, edge case or guardrail without a branch `[n]`, or citing a branch that doesn't support it;
- any choice in the brief no branch made;
- any missing check, or a check that is unrunnable, vacuous, or cannot fail at base / pass at head as intended (criteria must fail at base ea4086f and pass at head; guardrails must pass at both);
- slicing problems.
Be specific and brief. No praise. If something is fine, don't mention it.

